[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C02_C08_OPERATION_GREENLIGHT_ANTI]
Operation <=Redlight=>

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C02_C08_OPERATION_GREENLIGHT_ANTI_desc]
Through Starlight’s message, we have just learned... The Empire’s lunatic plan, the secret Operation <=Greenlight=>, is pushing the entire Ponyville to the brink of destruction...
We are not sure how the Empire will blow up Ponyville, where the bombs are buried, and we cannot openly investigate under the Empire’s nose... But there is still time.

Based on the information we have obtained so far, the Empire has prepared Operation <=Greenlight=> at §Y5§! locations, and we need to secretly find these “bombs” and dismantle them as soon as possible, without the Empire’s knowing.
Bomb 1: Located at §Y[529.GetName]§! [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb1Location] (Status: [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb1Status])
Bomb 2: Located at §Y[545.GetName]§! [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb2Location] (Status: [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb2Status])
Bomb 3: Located at §Y[235.GetName]§! [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb3Location] (Status: [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb3Status])
Bomb 4: Located at §Y[543.GetName]§! [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb4Location] (Status: [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb4Status])
Bomb 5: Located at §Y[504.GetName]§! [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb5Location] (Status: [GetC02OperationGreenlightBomb5Status])

